  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Failing tests first for each of the five strings.</step>
    <step order="2">Fix each with the smallest change; reuse existing label/metadata sources.</step>
    <step order="3">Filtered BFF tests (RuleBodyDescriber, DecisionActionCatalog, authoring catalog), full ArchTests, jest for OntologyAdmin/RuleWizard, DecisionWizard, Worklist; tsc; client-lint; Console build; publish-size delta.</step>
    <step order="4">PR to master; notes in notes/task-203-notes.md.</step>
  </steps>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Rule wizard Condition step lists display names with logical-name values; Actions step empty Next shows "Choose at least one action." and no "(plan_missing)". Tests fail on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Describer renders statecode by its label ("active"/"inactive") in the plain-language line; formal line unchanged. Test fails on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Assign Task text says "the person you choose"; the pinning test updated; no other catalog test changes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Worklist narrative body never sends past-due as a sibling category and never more categories than lanes; test fails on origin/master. Or a reported STOP if only a Dataverse write can fix it.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Builds, filtered tests, full ArchTests, jest, tsc, client-lint pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="false">Main session checks the strings on dev after the Console auto-deploy and the next uac-r2 dev BFF build.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>A fix needs a Dataverse, playbook or schema write, a new endpoint, or a change to an API reason code: STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>
